type: software
title: "Declarative Topology Synthesis (DTS)"
abstract: "Research software and Lean 4 formalization for declarative handler-topology synthesis in effect-handler languages with arrows. The project contains a mechanically verified topological-sort soundness proof and a Python reference implementation of the synthesis pipeline."
